      <article><span>02</span><h2>Define routes</h2><p>Compile a Python route table into a dependency-free browser router.</p><pre>routes = [{ "path": "/", "component": "HomePage" }, { "path": "/tutorial", "component": "TutorialPage" }]</pre></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h2>Mount once</h2><p>Your HTML shell only needs a mount point. The router renders the active component.</p><pre>&lt;div id="app"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
